========================================================================
PaddleOCR PP-OCRv5 mobile text detection (PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)
========================================================================

License: Apache License 2.0
Copyright (c) PaddlePaddle Authors
Upstream: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
Weights: https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv5_mobile_det (Apache-2.0)

libs/ai/models/textdet lowers the PP-OCRv5 mobile detection program
(inference.json + inference.pdiparams) to its own graph and file with our
converter (src/paddle.rs, loader/src/formats/paddle.rs) and runs it with its
own kernels; its pre-processing (longer side 960, multiples of 32, BGR
mean/std) and DB post-processing thresholds (0.3 / 0.6 / unclip 1.5) follow
the model's inference.yml. No upstream source is vendored. The converted
weights file is a derivative of the Apache-2.0 weights and carries this
notice.

